  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of Massakory-N&apos;Gouri-Bol Road Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at enhancing accessibility of the Northern Western agricultural Lake province to the other parts of the country as well as developing the trade exchange between Chad and Niger through upgrading the existing road (185 km) from an earth road to a modern paved one.</narrative>
  </description>
